<section class="effects" id="effects">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">四大核心功效一步到位</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">精准解决头皮困扰：深层控油平衡水油、植物配方去屑、舒缓头皮止痒、滋养发根固发。</p>
    <div class="effects-grid">
      <div class="effect-card">
        <div class="effect-img"><img src="{{ 'slide12_img2_38.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="平衡控油"></div>
        <h3>平衡控油</h3>
        <p>减少头皮油腻感，发根更蓬松。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="effect-card">
        <div class="effect-img"><img src="{{ 'slide12_img3_39.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="净屑清爽"></div>
        <h3>净屑清爽</h3>
        <p>帮助减少可见头屑与附着感。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="effect-card">
        <div class="effect-img"><img src="{{ 'slide12_img4_40.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="舒缓止痒"></div>
        <h3>舒缓止痒</h3>
        <p>减轻头皮紧绷与瘙痒不适。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="effect-card">
        <div class="effect-img"><img src="{{ 'slide12_img5_41.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="强韧固发"></div>
        <h3>强韧固发</h3>
        <p>改善发丝脆弱，降低断裂与拉扯损伤。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Effects","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Effects"}]}{% endschema %}
